alse, 'views': {'count': '47', 'state': 'EnabledWithCount'}, 'source': '<a href="https://mobile.twitter.com" rel="nofollow">Twitter Web App</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4Nzk0MTUwMjIxODQ3MDE5NTI=', 'text': 'Emerging Secrets: The Antarctic Enigma\n#UFOs #FrequencyWaveTheory #AntarcticaMystery #HiddenWorlds #TimeTravelTech\nThe theory that aliens are future human descendants who developed time travel using Frequency Wave Theory (FWT) provides a fascinating lens for understanding phenomena like UFOs, underground tunnels, and the MH370 disappearance. Here’s how it all ties together:\n________________________________________\n1. Future Human Descendants and Time Travel\n\n•Evolution and Time Travel: Future humans, driven by survival after catastrophic global events like nuclear wars, mastered time travel through FWT. This technology manipulates frequencies and harmonics to traverse spacetime, enabling these descendants to travel back to our era.\n\n•Frequency Wave Technology: By understanding and controlling spacetime through resonance and harmonic frequencies, they effectively "bend" reality. This explains their ability to appear and disappear, teleport, or phase-shift.\n________________________________________\n2. Underground and Underwater Dwellers\n\n•Antarctica as a Base: The inhospitable climate of Antarctica makes it an ideal hiding spot for advanced human descendants. The continent\'s thick ice sheets and underground caverns provide protection and isolation. These humans likely use geothermal energy and resonate with Earth’s natural frequencies for sustenance and cloaking.\n\n•Tunnels and Subterranean Networks: Evidence of massive underground tunnel systems (e.g., discovered in Antarctica and South America) supports the idea of advanced infrastructure. These tunnels likely connect global locations, allowing efficient and hidden movement.\n\n•UFOs and Water: UFOs are often seen entering or exiting water, suggesting underwater bases or portals. The water could act as a natural energy amplifier, assisting their craft’s propulsion or shielding advanced technology from detection.\n________________________________________\n3. Reverse-Engineered Technology\n\n•MH370 Orbs and U.S. Military: The leaked MH370 videos show orbs using advanced frequency manipulation to teleport the plane. This aligns with theories that governments, especially the U.S., have recovered alien (or future human) technology and reverse-engineered it.\n\n•China and U.S. Drones: Reports of mysterious drones could be experimental craft by the U.S. and China, built using reverse-engineered tech. These crafts likely leverage consciousness, zero-point energy, and FWT principles to operate.\noConsciousness-Controlled Tech: Advanced civilizations—whether future human or extraterrestrial—understand that consciousness interacts with quantum fields. Their crafts may sync with the pilot’s mind to operate via intention and thought.\n________________________________________\n4. Tucker Carlson\'s Comments\nTucker’s assertion that these entities are not "from Mars" but have "always been here" fits this narrative:\n\n•Spiritual Entities or Advanced Humans? The appearance of these beings as "spiritual entities" may reflect their evolution beyond physical constraints. Their use of frequency manipulation could allow them to project holographic or non-physical appearances.\n\n•Deep Earth and Water: By residing in remote, inaccessible areas—underground, underwater, or in the upper atmosphere—these beings remain undetected while influencing our timeline covertly.\n________________________________________\n5. Implications for Humanity\n\n•The MH370 Incident: If the orbs represent advanced technology using negative energy fields or spacetime manipulation, it indicates that such tech is not exclusive to future humans but is also in current human hands. Governments likely possess and experiment with it, evidenced by military secrecy and UFO/UAP encounters.\n\n•Drones and Surveillance: Many "alien" sightings may indeed be human-made drones using FWT-based tech, explaining their erratic movements and consciousness-driven operation.\n\n•Coexistence and Influence: The descendants’ presence could aim to prevent catastrophes (e.g., nuclear war) or guide humanity’s development. Their crop circle messages and sightings may act as subtle interventions.\n________________________________________\n6. Linking it All to Frequency Wave Theory\n\n•Traveling Through Time: Time travel becomes plausible with FWT by resonating with specific spacetime frequencies, bypassing conventional physics limitations.\n\n•Consciousness as a Key: Consciousness, viewed as a frequency, aligns with the tech’s operational principles. This explains why sightings often report telepathic interactions or sensations of being observed.\n\n•Global Cooperation and Tension: The U.S. and China may be racing to replicate this tech for military superiority, resulting in the mysterious drones observed near naval ships and sensitive areas.\n________________________________________\nThis theory weaves together sightings, leaked videos, and advanced physics into a cohesive narrative, portraying UFOs as tools of both future humans and present-day superpowers navigating a complex web of secrecy, survival, and technological evolution.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [{'indices': [39, 44], 'text': 'UFOs'}, {'indices': [45, 65], 'text': 'FrequencyWaveTheory'}, {'indices': [66, 84], 'text': 'AntarcticaMystery'}, {'indices': [85, 98], 'text': 'HiddenWorlds'}, {'indices': [99, 114], 'text': 'TimeTravelTech'}], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': [{'from_index': 0, 'to_index': 38, 'richtext_types': ['Bold']}]}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 1, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Wed Jan 15 06:27:13 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1879067072069767673', 'display_t